WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.800
The SCP Foundation is the most&nbsp;
powerful organization on planet Earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.760
Thanks to their cooperation with all world&nbsp;
governments as well as private organizations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:16.400
front businesses, and wealthy benefactors, they&nbsp;
have truly unlimited funds. Their ranks include&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.640
the best and brightest humanity has to offer,&nbsp;
and even some minds outside the human race.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.440
They have access to advanced and anomalous&nbsp;
technology from powerful weapons to memory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:33.440
wiping amnestics to state-of-the-art equipment&nbsp;
that even Elon Musk could only dream of.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.440
And this is a good thing, too, since we rely on&nbsp;
them to contain thousands of anomalies and stay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:45.680
vigilant for thousands or even millions more.&nbsp;
Everything from immortal lizards to supernatural&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:52.480
Sarkic flesh viruses to bonafide, reality-warping&nbsp;
demigods like the Deer, the Gate Guardian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:58.160
and the legendary Scarlet King. And who sits at&nbsp;
the tip of this mighty pyramid, delegating to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.200
everyone below and keeping the wheels turning&nbsp;
on this impossibly large behemoth of a group?

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:09.040
Of course, it’s the O5 Council! A group&nbsp;
of thirteen humans with so much money&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:15.280
and institutional power, they’re the closest a&nbsp;
non-anomalous figure can come to being a God.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.000
Also commonly known as O5 Command,&nbsp;
The Overseers, and the Overwatch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.720
people below Level 2 clearance at the&nbsp;
Foundation have no idea who they are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:31.200
or if they even actually exist. Those at Levels&nbsp;
3 and 4 know just enough to be terrified of them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:37.280
and little else. Between them, they know every&nbsp;
single secret kept by a Foundation known for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:43.280
utmost confidentiality. They are the hungry&nbsp;
spider at the center of this web of monsters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:51.040
magic, backstabbing, and espionage, noticing even&nbsp;
the tiniest of vibrations on their silk strings.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:56.080
Nothing about the O5 Council is simple or&nbsp;
straightforward. Of the information out there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:01.120
and available about them, there’s really no&nbsp;
way to know just how much of it is intentional&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:06.560
misinformation put out there to protect their&nbsp;
secrets. It’s said that they use complex layers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:11.760
of pseudonyms and body doubles. Some say that&nbsp;
each number in the Council actually represents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:17.760
several different people using the title. Some&nbsp;
say there are far fewer members than thirteen and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:24.320
these are just a series of smokescreens to avoid&nbsp;
detection. Some even say, to avoid total capture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:30.880
or assassination, at least one member remains in&nbsp;
a space station orbiting the earth at all times.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.560
Today, we’re going to tell you&nbsp;
what we know. Perhaps it’s true,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:40.480
perhaps it isn’t, but as with all things regarding&nbsp;
the O5 Council, it’s certain to be fascinating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:45.120
either way. We’re going to look at the Council’s&nbsp;
role in the Foundation, the kind of staff and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:50.400
Mobile Task Force that works around them, and some&nbsp;
of the scattered and often contradictory theories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:56.080
about the identities of each of the thirteen&nbsp;
members of this exclusive Foundation cabal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:01.680
We hope you have your Level 5 clearance too, or&nbsp;
we both might not make it to the end of the video.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:05.280
This is the SCP Foundation’s O5 Council.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:10.240
Like a lot of secret organizations, the&nbsp;
Foundation goes to great lengths to make sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:15.040
their forbidden knowledge remains secret.&nbsp;
That’s why low level junior researchers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:19.760
guards, and janitorial staff aren’t privy&nbsp;
to where all the bodies are buried - both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:25.200
literally and metaphorically speaking. The&nbsp;
Foundation has five levels of security clearance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:31.440
and the O5 Council and their select staff are&nbsp;
the only ones who are at security Level 5 - also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:37.680
known as Thaumiel Clearance. O5 Council members&nbsp;
are also considered Class A Foundation Staff,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:42.000
meaning they are of critical value&nbsp;
to the operations of the Foundation.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.400
As such, they’re not permitted to interact&nbsp;
with any anomalies for fear of corruption,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:52.560
alteration, or death. Though of course, seeing&nbsp;
as they’re the most powerful people on earth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:57.360
they don’t always follow their own rules&nbsp;
on this one. In the event of an emergency,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:02.000
their evacuation and transportation to a&nbsp;
designated Safe Zone becomes a top priority&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:08.080
to all Foundation underlings. They rarely, if&nbsp;
ever, interact with the majority of the Foundation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:13.680
instead favoring to use a vast network of&nbsp;
messengers and go-betweens for security purposes.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:18.960
Much like the US Supreme Court, being a member&nbsp;
of the O5 Council is supposed to be a lifetime&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:24.080
appointment, and the death and or replacement&nbsp;
of a member of the O5 Council is considered a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:29.440
truly extraordinary event. On occasion, there&nbsp;
have been rumors of the O5 members performing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:34.880
power moves and killing their own colleagues&nbsp;
to consolidate control. This type of event is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:39.360
thought to have been the ultimate fate of Dr.&nbsp;
Jack Bright’s father, who supposedly ascended&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:44.560
to the position of O5 in hopes of freeing his&nbsp;
anomalous daughter from containment. Rumor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:49.280
has it that he was assassinated by his fellow&nbsp;
Council members and replaced for his trouble.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:54.080
While the O5 Council aren’t meant to interact&nbsp;
with any anomalies, this isn’t always the case&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:59.360
in practice. It’s possible that members of the&nbsp;
O5 Council make regular use of their access to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:07.200
SCP-006, a small well whose water has the ability&nbsp;
to cure disease and imbue vitality, health, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:12.960
longevity in anyone who drinks it. It’s believed&nbsp;
by some that, as a precaution against potential&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:19.680
attacks from powerful reality warpers and CK Class&nbsp;
reality restructuring events, each member of O5&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:26.240
carries a small charm made from the flesh of a&nbsp;
deceased but immensely strong reality warper. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.960
supposedly creates a pocket of dimensional&nbsp;
stability around them wherever they go.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:35.200
While it’s believed that all members&nbsp;
of O5 Council are fundamentally human,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:40.480
it’s possible or even likely that many of them&nbsp;
have experienced anomalous alterations during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:45.760
their ascent to ultimate power. They’re also said&nbsp;
to surround themselves with a number of powerful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:50.880
anomalous individuals for protection.&nbsp;
Which leads us nicely to our next point:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:57.120
Who works directly with the notoriously private&nbsp;
and inaccessible O5 Council? Let’s take a look.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:01.760
First, the O5 Council’s muscle,&nbsp;
Mobile Task Force Alpha-01,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:06.960
appropriately nicknamed the Red Right&nbsp;
Hand. These are the best of the best,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:12.320
handpicked for both skill and absolute loyalty&nbsp;
to the Council. They work with an extra layer of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:19.520
secrecy and accept their orders directly from O5.&nbsp;
If the Council decides it doesn’t care for you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:25.200
then the red laser dot that appears on your head&nbsp;
an hour later is attached to the rifle of a Red&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:30.720
Right Hand operative. This is a group with a&nbsp;
checkered past though. Many of their members are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:36.320
believed to have splintered from the group to form&nbsp;
the Chaos Insurgency, a group in direct opposition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:41.600
to the Foundation. Though if you ever bring this&nbsp;
up within earshot of a member of the O5 Council,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:46.800
your likelihood of going mysteriously&nbsp;
missing shortly after is extremely high.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:51.200
But it takes more than just guns to keep&nbsp;
the Foundation’s mission moving forward.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.280
The figure who represents the interests of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:57.760
O5 Council on the world stage is&nbsp;
known simply as The Administrator.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:03.760
This mysterious, eccentric, and likely anomalous&nbsp;
figure is the powerful mouthpiece of the Council,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:08.880
and it’s a role that’s been held by a number of&nbsp;
people since the Foundation was first founded.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:13.760
The other staff assigned to the O5 Council&nbsp;
are sometimes referred to as the Factotum,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:18.720
and these are some of the only people outside&nbsp;
of the O5 Council occasionally afforded Level&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:24.880
5 clearances. These bodyguards and personal&nbsp;
assistants are often immensely powerful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:29.280
both in the sense that they wield a great deal&nbsp;
of institutional strength, and that they’re&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:35.200
often powerful anomalies themselves. Don’t expect&nbsp;
just anyone to get elected to these positions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:40.640
after all. Only the very best get to work&nbsp;
in close proximity to the O5 Council.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:46.960
So, this leaves us with the big question: Who&nbsp;
exactly are the O5 Council? The short answer is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:52.640
that we don’t know for sure, and the information&nbsp;
we do have about the thirteen most powerful people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.640 --> 00:08:00.000
in the world is often contradictory and strange.
First, we have O5-1, often considered the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.920
powerful of the entire Council. Many believe&nbsp;
that O5-1 is one of the occult holdovers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:11.120
from the member organizations that first&nbsp;
started the Foundation, and if that’s true,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:17.520
O5-1 is likely to be at least 200 years old.&nbsp;
They’ve been able to survive to this age&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:24.560
thanks to magical or anomalous intervention. The&nbsp;
race and gender of O5-1 varies between accounts.&nbsp;

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:30.080
O5-2 Is considered to be one of the more&nbsp;
actively anomalous of the O5 Council members.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:35.200
While accounts are split on whether they are male&nbsp;
or female, consistent elements in stories about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:40.400
them paint the picture of an elderly person&nbsp;
with clues to a mysterious past, like having&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:47.120
crucifixion scars, or consistent ties to Dr.&nbsp;
Sophia Light, a holdover from an erased timeline.&nbsp;

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:54.000
O5-3 is consistently seen as male, and largely&nbsp;
seen as being of European descent, regardless&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:59.200
of the other details shared. He’s generally&nbsp;
considered to be extremely intelligent, as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:04.640
well as one of the nicer members of the Council,&nbsp;
acting as a kind of conscience for the others.&nbsp;

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:09.840
O5-4 is another figure considered to be most&nbsp;
likely male, and the circumstances of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.160
entrance into the Council are generally&nbsp;
considered to be rather spectacular…&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:18.720
whether you believe the story that they&nbsp;
got in by killing the previous O5-4&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:23.680
during a hostile takeover situation or that&nbsp;
they were the first to collect the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:30.560
Little Mister series from Dr. Wondertainment.
O5-5 Is also most likely male, and some accounts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:35.440
consider him to be one of the more front-facing&nbsp;
members of the Council. He’s more likely to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:40.000
interact with the public than the others, and&nbsp;
it’s speculated that he’s the one who runs the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:45.280
vast network of front businesses regularly&nbsp;
used for cover by the Foundation at large.&nbsp;

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:51.760
O5-6 is most likely male, and probably of&nbsp;
European descent. His reputation is mixed though.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:56.320
Some speculate that he was formally the&nbsp;
Foundation’s top field agent, while others believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:02.160
he’s a puppet of the Global Occult Coalition,&nbsp;
one of the Foundation’s rival organizations. To&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:07.600
some, he’s known as “The Cowboy.”
Some believe that O5-7 is a woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:12.240
of South Asian descent. She’s said&nbsp;
to be a charismatic master tactician,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:18.160
and plays a crucial role in selecting and hiring&nbsp;
the elite staff that work around the O5 Council.&nbsp;

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:25.200
O5-8 is one of the more mysterious figures, even&nbsp;
among the already extremely secretive O5 Council.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:29.040
Some speculate that they may have been&nbsp;
assassinated, as they haven’t been seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:34.880
in public for quite some time, though this may&nbsp;
just be a ruse to fool would-be backstabbers.&nbsp;

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:41.760
O5-9 is another somewhat controversial figure&nbsp;
within the Council. Some believe that O5-9 is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:45.840
a woman hired to join the Council directly&nbsp;
from the public sector after a scandal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:51.600
Others believe that O5-9 is merely the&nbsp;
informal title for whomever is the acting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:57.680
head of the Foundation Intelligence Agency.
O5-10 is widely believed to have vast combat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:02.640
experience of one form or another.&nbsp;
Some refer to them as The Assassin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:07.840
a female former Foundation hitman who’s&nbsp;
likely the most proficient killer alive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:14.080
Others call them The Veteran or The Mad General,&nbsp;
a former high level member of the US military.&nbsp;

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:19.600
It’s speculated by some that O5-11 is a&nbsp;
high level politician placed by Council on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:25.600
the United States Senate to maintain Foundation&nbsp;
control over political questions and dealings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:30.880
Others believe he’s an eighty year old Japanese&nbsp;
bureaucrat with self-esteem issues. Yet another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:35.920
rumor states that this person is actually the&nbsp;
Foundation’s chief disinformation officer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:40.480
so maybe both of these rumors are just&nbsp;
lies meant to lead us off the track.&nbsp;

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:47.600
O5-12 is believed by many to have once been Adam&nbsp;
Bright, father of famous Foundation researcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:53.680
and anomaly Dr. Jack Bright. He worked his way&nbsp;
onto the Council to try to free his own daughter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.680 --> 00:12:00.320
SCP - 321, from containment, and was assassinated&nbsp;
by his fellow Council members in the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:07.920
Or O5-12 might be the accountant for the Overseer&nbsp;
Council. Maybe one day we’ll know whether O5-12&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:12.240
is best known for being someone who climbed&nbsp;
the ranks of the most powerful organization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:16.880
in the world to save his daughter or&nbsp;
if he just really likes spreadsheets.&nbsp;

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:22.640
Whether O5-13 ever actually existed is&nbsp;
hotly debated. Many speculate that there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:28.720
were originally only 12 members, and that 13&nbsp;
was added as a tiebreaker in Council votes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:34.960
Others say 13 was only added due to the&nbsp;
modern occult significance of the number 13.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:40.000
Some believe there is no 13, and it’s&nbsp;
merely another attempt to keep everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:46.720
on their toes. Or there’s a rumor that all of&nbsp;
the members of the council are O5-13, taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:52.560
turns to act as the tie breaking thirteenth vote.
Whatever the case is with any of the particular&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:57.600
members of the group, the O5 Council is one of&nbsp;
the smallest and yet, most important groups of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:02.800
people in the SCP Foundation Universe.&nbsp;
They’re the ones behind everything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:08.160
hearing every whisper and pulling every&nbsp;
string. And if you know anything about them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:14.240
even the facts you just saw in this video,&nbsp;
it’s probably only because they want you to.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:20.160
Now go check out “SCP Chaos Insurgency&nbsp;
Explained” and “SCP - 001 - Which Is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:26.720
The Real 001?” for more explorations into&nbsp;
the lore of the SCP Foundation universe.

